universe u v w x y

/-
Domain-style sampling for Lemma 15.8.1:
- primary domain: determinantal ideals of matrices over a commutative ring and their basic
  functoriality/block-decomposition properties;
- sampled downstream owner-level declarations:
  `presentationFittingIdeal`,
  `LinearMap.rankMinorIdeal`,
  `exists_mul_eq_smul_one_of_mem_minorIdeal`,
  `pow_mem_minorIdeal_of_exists_mul_eq_smul_one`;
- best owner abstraction: the matrix-level owner `Matrix.minorIdeal`; the Fitting-ideal and
  linear-map constructions in later files are derived API built from this owner rather than
  separate competing notions, while the Lean surface notation `I_(r)(A)` records the textbook
  determinantal ideal `I_r(A)`;
- primitive data: a size `r` and a matrix `A`;
- derived API: membership of a chosen minor, antitonicity in `r`, behavior under restricting rows,
